cage_hints = PackedStringArray("castaway_parrot_outpost|Look up! The crabs locked a parrot on our own watchtower. Climb the crates by the blue hut.", "castaway_parrot_wreck|I hear squawking from your shipwreck\'s crow\'s nest. Up the stern deck and keep climbing!", "castaway_parrot_summit|There\'s a cage on the hill summit. Take the terraces, or kick your way up the chimney.", "castaway_parrot_stack|A cage sits on the sea stack off the wreck. Only a mighty long jump gets you there.", "driftwood_parrot_tower|Southwest, over the water: Driftwood Key! A cage tops a tower of lashed rafts.", "driftwood_parrot_pen|More on Driftwood Key: the crabs keep one in a pen up on the knoll. Guarded, mind you.")
